<title>USA: Nanometrics wins $5 mln in Asia orders.</title>
<headline>Nanometrics wins $5 mln in Asia orders.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nanometrics Inc said late Wednesday that it has won $5 million in orders for its automated film metrology products from semiconductor and flat panel display manufacturers in Korea and Taiwan.</p>
<p>&quot;In only two months the value of our orders have exceeded the Pacific Rim shipments we made in all of 1996,&quot; Nanometrics President John Heaton said in a release.</p>
<p>The company did not specify the length of the contract and could not be immediately reached for further comment.</p>
</text>
